	<false/>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>fetch</string>
	</array>
	<key>BGTaskSchedulerPermittedIdentifiers</key>
	<array>
		<string>com.mayutic.ration.health-export</string>
	</array>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Ration doesn't read data from Apple Health. It only writes the foods you log, and it can remove the foods it wrote when you edit or delete a log or turn off Apple Health in Ration.</string>
	<key>NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Ration writes foods you log, and it does not copy an AI estimate until you accept it. It updates or removes them when you edit or delete a log. It doesn't write daily totals, weight, or activity.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Ration uses the camera to scan grocery receipts and pantry labels, and to photograph a meal when you log what you ate.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Ration uses your photo library for receipt and pantry photos, Supply imports, and profile or group images.</string>
	<key>UIAppFonts</key>
	<array>
		<string>SpaceMono-Regular.ttf</string>
		<string>SpaceMono-Bold.ttf</string>
	</array>
	<key>RevenueCatPublicAPIKey</key>
	<string>appl_pUrEkfszvAWSscslkeXEMleEace</string>
